    "title": "5 takeaways from the judge's statements during Sherrone Moore's sentencing - NewsBreak",
    "text": "7 hours ago PITTSFIELD TWP., MI - Although former Wolverines football coach Sherrone Moore had little to say at his own sentencing, the judge overseeing his case did not. In an unusual move, 14A-1 District Court Judge J. Cedric Simpson spoke for roughly 30 minutes before sentencing Moore on Tuesday, April 14. During his address to Moore, he touched on the prosecutor’s role in the case and the strength of Moore’s wife, among other topics. Read full article\nRead in NewsBreak",
